+``--demuxer-mkv-probe-image=<yes|no>``
+    Check whether a video track holds a single still image (default: yes). This
+    reads the first video packets when the file is opened. With ``no``, opening
+    reads nothing past the headers, so playback that starts elsewhere (``--start``)
+    does not need the beginning of a streamed file; a cover-art-like track is then
+    treated as video.
+
